This repository is a modified version of AlpaSim (https://github.com/NVlabs/alpasim),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).  The original
AlpaSim README is kept in docs/ALPASIM_README.md.

Modifications (see README.md, "What this repository adds"):
  - a runtime safety validator for end-to-end driving policies, with LiDAR and
    radar obstacle sensing and fusion (src/driver/src/alpasim_driver/);
  - simulated radar, rendered LiDAR forwarding, lead-vehicle braking and sensor
    weather effects in the runtime (src/runtime/alpasim_runtime/);
  - sensor payload formats (src/utils/alpasim_utils/);
  - a LiDAR perception package (src/lidar_perception/);
  - wizard configurations for the validator and scenarios (src/wizard/configs/exp/);
  - the experiment scripts and results of the accompanying paper (benchmark/).
